      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "FENDI's 2027 Resort collection brings the Croissant bag — born in the 1990s — back into the spotlight. Inspired by the croissant pastry 🥐, the design pairs an elegant yet playful half-moon silhouette with the classic FF buckle, its compact form capturing an easy, unhurried attitude.",
