    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Croissant made its debut on the FENDI Fall/Winter 1999 runway. An offshoot of the Baguette®, its crescent-shaped body strikes a clever balance between whimsy and practicality, slipping seamlessly into looks for every occasion from day to night.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "text": null,
      "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/uasidrw/b9c0199eb0958c44.jpg",
      "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/uasidrw/2d286b31940de95b.jpg",
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "caption",
      "text": "FENDI Croissant bag, Fall/Winter 1999 collection",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Croissant carries over the instantly recognizable half-moon silhouette and FF clasp, while a newly designed adjustable strap allows for more versatile ways to wear it — tucked under the arm for a nonchalant look, or worn crossbody to keep hands free. At 94cm, the strap sits comfortably even over heavy fall/winter outerwear. Measuring 14×22×3cm, the body holds a standard smartphone, wallet, keys, lipstick and other daily essentials, delivering both good looks and real utility.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
