      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The special-edition Croissant is fully embroidered with sequins, evoking the purple sequined Baguette snatched in Sex and the City — a fitting nod to that iconic moment. Two extra-long fringe styles are also offered: one in black-and-white panther-print pony calfskin, the other in black vintage calfskin, with flowing long fringes that bring a sense of movement to the bag.",
